{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a racer in a cursed machine.<br>Heavy, armored, and built for speed, it roars into the fog.<br>You tear down the track, dodging horrors and chasing the blood quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coins spill onto the road \u2014 fuel for upgrades: tougher armor, a faster engine, sharper steel.<br>Every lap is survival. Every race is blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then it\u2019s back onto the track \u2014 new routes to master, new beasts to outrun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1758660233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499860?t=1758660233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/d014b412296abba5e13cac8360ec20ef0074f803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758660233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499860/d014b412296abba5e13cac8360ec20ef0074f803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758660233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and gore.\r\nPlayers will drive a car to run over monsters, which is accompanied by intense blood splatter, dismemberment, and other graphic effects. All of this takes place in a dark, oppressive horror atmosphere. This content may be disturbing to sensitive players and is not recommended for children or teenagers."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-Lovecraftian wasteland, you are a racer in a cursed machine.<br>Heavy, armored, and built for speed, it roars into the fog.<br>You tear down the track, dodging horrors and chasing the blood quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"